# Repository Structure

- App Router and locales: `src/app/[locale]/` with existing locale-specific handling.
- Studio homepage composition at current checkpoint: `src/app/[locale]/page.tsx` → `src/app/[locale]/_components/SignalHeroPrototype.tsx` and `_components/v2/` (including actual `SelectedWork`). Verify actual source before integrating.
- New Infinite Website review experiments: `public/flagship-journey/infinite-opening-study/` and `public/flagship-journey/infinite-bc/` are **opt-in historical/experimental artifacts**, not the production React homepage.
- Separate digital-card app: `src/app/[locale]/start/` and its `components/`, `lib/types.ts`, `lib/presets.ts` as applicable.
- Shared configuration and constants: `src/constants/`; localization: `src/lib/home-i18n.ts` and existing route middleware.
- Favor concise modules; avoid arbitrary rewrites. Do not add new dependencies without explicit approval. Never move or remove existing application routes because the homepage direction changed.
